456:Let $\nu$ be a place of $\QQ$. Here we fix a unique representative of each $\QQ_\nu$-equivalence class of $\QQ_\nu$-quadratic forms. We call these \textit{standard $\QQ_\nu$-quadratic forms}. They will be constantly used in the article.
