$d = 3$ & $c(x_1^2 + x_2^2 + x_3^2)$ for any $c \in \mathcal{C}_2$ & $x_1^2 - \ntt_p x_2^2 + \ntt_p p x_3^2$ \\
 & & $x_1^2 + p x_2^2 - \ntt_p p x_3^2$ \\
 & & $\ntt_p x_1^2 + p x_2^2 - \ntt_p p x_3^2$ \\
 \hline
