    """Return ``(B, factor)`` where B is an integer matrix with
    ``B[i][j] == A[i][j] * L_i`` and ``factor == prod(L_i)``, L_i the lcm of the
    denominators in row i.  Hence ``det(A) == det(B) / factor``.  Internal."""
    B = []
    factor = 1
    for row in A:
        L = 1
        for x in row:
