+r"""Verified generators for S-integral equivalences of quadratic forms.
+
+The paper studies exact equivalence ``Q_1 \circ g = Q_2`` with
+``g in GL(d, Z_S)``.  Here ``S = {infinity, 2}``, and the answer is a
+degree-one rational polynomial whose value at the relative operator is such
+an equivalence matrix.  Instances are inverse-generated from an integral
+self-adjoint projector, so generation never solves the public instance.
+
+The module is deterministic in ``(n, seed, params)``, standard-library-only
+when ``gvlib`` is unavailable, silent on import, and performs no file I/O.
+"""
